          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "I'm looking for a moderately priced restaurant that serves Austrian food."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "I'm sorry, but there are no restaurants matching that request."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "What about British food instead?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "There are five moderately priced British restaurants. Saint Johns Chop House is in the west, while Cotto, Restaurant One Seven, The Copper Kettle, and The Oak Bistro are in the centre."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Saint Johns Chop House sounds good. Could you give me the phone number?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Yes. The phone number is 01223 353110."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Thank you. That's all I need."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Goodbye."
